{"4784980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Contrail Blazer", "steam_appid": 4784980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・It's a side-view airplane game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Trail Action &gt; You can circle items or enemy attacks with your contrail to make them yours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Only a few buttons needed, so it's not hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・You can choose between two main characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　There's a story mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　You'll see &quot;the incident&quot; from each of their different points of view</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Each mission is about 3 minutes, so it's easy to pick up and play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Not a game for long, heavy sessions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Controller only, no mouse/keyboard support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Not a bullet hell game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　There are delivery/adventure-focused missions and combat-focused missions,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　but no bullet hell elements, just so you know</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・The setting is a world locked in winter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　If you're into ruins or dystopian stuff, you might like it</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・All the characters were drawn by hand, in pencil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　I also play some of the instruments myself sometimes, like concertina and fiddle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　If you're into that kind of low-key, handmade feel, come check it out</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・AI was used to make the icons</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・It's a side-view airplane game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Trail Action &gt; You can circle items or enemy attacks with your contrail to make them yours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >　Only a few buttons needed, so it's not hard</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >・Yo